## Brand Overview

Founded in 2013, Blackview initially focused on rugged outdoor smartphones designed for outdoor activities, engineering work, and demanding environments. Blackview is committed to applying advanced technology to create reliable, affordable smart products that make technology more accessible wherever users go. Its products are used in outdoor exploration, camping and travel, construction, engineering, warehousing and logistics, field data collection, mobile work, education and entertainment, sports and wellness, and everyday home life. Some rugged smartphones and tablets claim compliance with protection and durability standards such as IP68, IP69K, or MIL-STD-810H, while some products provide CE, FCC, and RoHS market compliance information. Certifications, protection ratings, and operating conditions vary by model and sales region; refer to the relevant product page, user manual, or official certification document.

