## Product Features and Use Cases

- Thermal imaging devices: Used for identifying temperature differences, detecting electrical overheating, equipment maintenance, and outdoor observation. Refer to product specifications for exact temperature measurement capabilities.
- Night vision devices: Designed for low-light environments, outdoor activities, inspections, and nighttime photography.
- Projection devices: Selected smartphones and tablets include built-in projection for mobile presentations and audiovisual entertainment.
- Satellite communication devices: Selected rugged smartphones support satellite messaging or communication. Service coverage, subscriptions, and regional availability depend on the specific product.
- Large-battery devices: Designed for extended outdoor activities, engineering work, and mobile productivity. Actual battery life depends on the operating environment and device settings.
- Kids tablets: Selected LINK and Tab products are designed for learning, entertainment, and family management.

